		<div data-particle_enable="false" data-particle-mobile-disabled="false" class="elementor-element elementor-element-8b6f1dc e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="8b6f1dc" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container" id="ABOUT">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-040b22b elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="040b22b" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
					<h2 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">SPACE IS COOL
BUT HAVE YOU 
TRIED BEER?</h2>				</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-bb74fe3 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget-tablet__width-inherit elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="bb74fe3" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									<p class="font_8">Bad Astronaut Brewing company was founded with only one goal in mind: brew badass beers and have a damn good time. With a shared thirst for craft beer and a passion for quality, every aspect of Bad Astronaut is designed to provide an out-of-world experience for Houstonians. Winning awards, praise, fortune, and glory is nice and all, but ultimately, we&#8217;re just happy to be able to do what we love and share it with you.</p><p class="font_8"><span class="wixGuard">​</span>Our 36,000 sq. ft. brewery &amp; taproom is located just north of downtown Houston, TX. Our mission is simple; to create an atmosphere where friends can make memories, drink stellar beer, and have a hell of a good time</p>								</div>
				</div>
		<div data-particle_enable="false" data-particle-mobile-disabled="false" class="elementor-element elementor-element-19e8467 e-con-full e-grid e-con e-child" data-id="19e8467" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
